Output docs/assets/clips/away-mode.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 750
Set Padding 12
Set Framerate 12
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set CursorBlink false

Hide
Type `exec "$KDEMO_DIR/env.sh" herdr`
Enter
Sleep 4s
Ctrl+B
Type "b"
Sleep 300ms
Ctrl+B
Type "h"
Sleep 500ms
Show

# Away: the lead settles how-questions itself.
Sleep 1.5s
Type "A"
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 6.5s

# Back: the lead writes what happened.
Type "A"
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 7s
